# The functions no main package of this module reaches that stay, each with its reason
# (design LIF-7; checked by scripts/deadcode-check.sh, which also fails on an entry that has
# gone stale). Format: package directory, function as deadcode names it, reason.
#
# Prefer deleting the code, or moving a helper only its own package's tests use into a _test.go
# file of that package. An entry is for what cannot do either: an interface method a type must
# have, a function reached only through reflection or go:linkname, or a helper the tests of
# another package call (Go shares no _test.go code across packages).

# Cross-package test helpers in packages a binary links.
sim Fates cross-package test helper: sim/cluster's TestFates_EveryFateHasAKnownBadScenario enumerates every fate through it, and the fate list is unexported
sim/cluster NewClusterSimulator cross-package test helper: the tests of cmd and sim/llmd build clusters with it; replacing it with BuildClusterSimulator needs sim/cluster/cluster.go, held by another open change
sim/workload AgentXReplay.InFlight cross-package test helper: sim/cluster's agentx integration test checks the replay's in-flight count with it
sim/workload TraceFieldStatus cross-package test helper: cmd's SIM-11 trace-field test reads the field-status tables through it, and the tables are unexported
sim/workload SessionManager.States cross-package test helper: sim/cluster's disaggregation test tallies session states with it (INV-11)
sim/workload SessionPoolDriver.Unstarted cross-package test helper: tools/harness's protocol test checks that the pool pushed every session

# internal/invariantscan is a test-helper package: the INV-1 conservation tests of sim and
# sim/cluster scan their own test files with it. No binary imports it.
internal/invariantscan InstanceBuckets test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan ClusterOnlyBuckets test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan Finding.String test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan bucketSet test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan bucketNameOf test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan exprKey test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan bucketsIn test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan isLedger test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan FindConservationSums test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan scanScope test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster
internal/invariantscan ScanTestDir test-helper package used by the tests of sim and sim/cluster

